values ('조개 풍경 (Wind Chimes of Shells)', NULL, '조개껍데기를 줄에 엮어 천장에서 길게 늘어뜨린 풍경이다. 바람을 받으면 조개가 흔들리는 구조다.', NULL, '조개껍데기, 줄', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','풍경','조개','몬트리올','설치']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/914.webp?v=79f62dc898', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/914.webp?v=0c3bf26286', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/914.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/914.txt', NULL, 0.511, 'CC BY-SA 4.0', 'Mervat / Own work / CC BY-SA 4.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wind_Chimes_of_Shells.jpg')
