values ('사운드 리플렉터와 역회전 터빈 (Sound reflectors, counter-rotating turbine)', NULL, '둥근 금속 반사판 두 개와 가운데 역회전 터빈 날개가 있는 야외 키네틱 조형물이다.', NULL, '금속 원판, 금속 날개', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','야외조각','바람','터빈']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/320.webp?v=50d424265b', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/320.webp?v=55823b8904', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/320.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/320.txt', NULL, 0.266, 'CC BY-SA 2.0', 'Bill Abbott / Sound reflectors, counter-rotating turbine, hilltop art, Seal Point Park, City of San Mateo, California / CC BY-SA 2.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sound_reflectors,_counter-rotating_turbine,_hilltop_art,_Seal_Point_Park,_City_of_San_Mateo,_California_(7010503353).jpg')
