values ('빈드슈필 (Windspiel)', 'Sculpture', '그뢰미츠 해변 광장에 설치된 바람 조각 ''빈드슈필(Windspiel)''이다. 곡선형 강철 날 위에 원형 장치가 얹혀 있다.', 1990, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','바람 조각','야외 설치','강철']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1279.webp?v=7ae1b48831', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1279.webp?v=99c8a99d66', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1279.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1279.txt', NULL, 0.615, 'CC BY-SA 3.0', 'OTFW , Berlin / Self-photographed / CC BY-SA 3.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skulptur_Seebr%C3%BCckenvorplatz_(Gr%C3%B6mitz)_Windspiel%26%2619902.jpg')
