values ('에니그마 (Enigma)', '도로시 태너 (Dorothy Tanner)', '도로시 태너의 빛 조각 ''에니그마''다. 사각 패널 안에서 붉은색과 주황색 원형 빛이 빛나는 형태다.', 2014, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','빛 조각','설치미술','도로시 태너']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1702.webp?v=3f9edae9e5', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1702.webp?v=10795eaab7', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1702.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1702.txt', NULL, 0.51, 'CC BY-SA 2.0', 'Marc Billard / https://www.flickr.com/photos/154889141@N07/38094768714/in/photolist-dAjB22-dYuk8u-dYujS1-j2KLC4-j6eppP-dYujZ1-4Vpfnj-bRuBgB-dYoBsR-4Vg6DJ-4VpfGf-213iDx9-4Vpf9o-5qfYvh-CuuBst-4Vk27g-4VpgTd-4VpeH7-511UN6-4Vg76s-4VpfVG-4VbSox-4Vpg9o-4Vk3Ng-4Vpgv5 / CC BY-SA 2.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Enigma_Light_Sculpture_by_Dorothy_Tanner_2014.jpg')
