values ('바람 놀이 (Windspiel)', '괴츠 도를 (Goetz Dorl)', '베를린 펜프푸흐 공원에 설치된 바람 조각으로, 여러 겹의 은색 금속 날개가 기둥 위에 달려 있다.', 1989, '금속', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','풍력','바람','조각','베를린']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1332.webp?v=064e68aeed', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1332.webp?v=5a1a99519e', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1332.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1332.txt', NULL, 1.252, 'CC BY-SA 3.0', 'OTFW , Berlin / Self-photographed / CC BY-SA 3.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skulptur_Fennpfuhlpark_(Fenpf)_Windspiel%26Goetz_Dorl%2619892.jpg')
