values ('퍼뮤테이셔널 구조물 (Structure Permutacional)', '프란시스코 소브리노 (Francisco Sobrino)', '거울 면 금속 패널로 된 입방체 모듈이 엇갈려 배열된 조각이다.', 2008, '금속 (거울 면 패널)', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','옵아트','금속','거울','조각']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1559.webp?v=c72d901da0', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1559.webp?v=7d91c7baa0', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1559.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1559.txt', NULL, 0.512, 'CC BY 2.0', 'Lauren from South Carolina, USA / Structure Permutacional / CC BY 2.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Structure_Permutacional.jpg')
