values ('바람놀이 (Windspiel)', '한스 회프너 (Hans Hoepfner)', '기둥에 여러 금속 판을 엇갈려 단 바람놀이 조각이다.', 2001, '금속 기둥, 금속 판', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','바람','조각','베를린']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1329.webp?v=fa7986d60b', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1329.webp?v=aa7548e28d', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1329.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1329.txt', NULL, 0.664, 'CC BY-SA 3.0', 'OTFW , Berlin / Self-photographed / CC BY-SA 3.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Skulptur_Albertinenstr_26_(Wei%C3%9Fs)_Windspiel%26Hans_Hoepfner%2620013.jpg')
