values ('후린 풍경 (Fuurin)', NULL, '일본 여름에 쓰는 풍경(風鈴)으로, 바람에 울리는 소리가 더위를 식혀 준다.', 2007, '유리, 종이 단자쿠(시각 확인)', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','풍경','바람','일본']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1367.webp?v=f2ad7330b8', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1367.webp?v=6994b2d4ff', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1367.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1367.txt', NULL, 0.231, 'CC BY-SA 2.5', 'The original uploader was Michalkun at English Wikipedia . / Transferred from en.wikipedia to Commons. / CC BY-SA 2.5 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fuurin.jpg')
