values ('지구·태양·달·내행성 기계 모형 (Mechanical model of Earth, Sun, Moon and inner planet)', NULL, '태양, 지구, 달과 내행성을 기계 장치로 연결해 움직이게 한 천문 기계 모형이다.', 2013, '금속, 목재(시각 확인)', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','천문','기계 모형','교육']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1979.webp?v=9b750e5f15', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1979.webp?v=ad156056b1', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1979.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1979.txt', NULL, 0.438, 'CC BY-SA 3.0', 'Joe Mabel (on Flickr as Joe Mabel from Seattle, US) / Mechanical model of Earth, Sun, Moon and inner planet 01 Uploaded by Jmabel / CC BY-SA 3.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mechanical_model_of_Earth,_Sun,_Moon_and_inner_planet_01_(9372527901).jpg')
