values ('오존파크 경주마 풍향계 (Ozone Pk racehorse wind vane)', NULL, '경주마 모양의 풍향계로, 원뿔형 지붕 탑 위에 설치되어 있다.', 1890, '금속 (도장)', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','풍향계','경마','바람','건축장식']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1752.webp?v=c20d43008f', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1752.webp?v=0d26336487', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1752.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1752.txt', NULL, 0.351, 'CC BY-SA 4.0', 'CaptJayRuffins / Own work / CC BY-SA 4.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ozone_Pk_racehorse_wind_vane_20190208_144726-EFFECTS.jpg')
