values ('퀸즐랜드 미술관 조각 정원의 물 조형물 (Water features in Sculpture Courtyard of Queensland Art Gallery)', NULL, '미술관 조각 정원에서 방사형 막대를 단 구체 구조물 사이로 물줄기가 흩뿌려지는 수경 조형물이다.', 2016, '금속 구조물, 물줄기', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','수경조형','물','조각정원']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1545.webp?v=a5ab9703c4', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1545.webp?v=6c8ac08d0f', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1545.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1545.txt', NULL, 0.122, 'CC BY 4.0', 'Heritage branch staff, Vic Bushing / State of Queensland: Queensland Heritage Register: Water features in Sculpture Courtyard of Queensland Art Gallery (2016) / CC BY 4.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Water_features_in_Sculpture_Courtyard_of_Queensland_Art_Gallery_(2016).jpg')
