values ('프랜섬 대장간 풍향계 (Fransham Forge weather vane)', NULL, '배 모양 금속 실루엣을 단 풍향계로, 바람 방향에 따라 돌며 방향을 가리킨다.', 1865, '금속', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','풍향계','바람','금속']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1503.webp?v=0955a1521d', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1503.webp?v=b99e31f443', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1503.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1503.txt', NULL, 0.058, 'CC BY-SA 2.0', 'Evelyn Simak / From geograph.org.uk / CC BY-SA 2.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fransham_Forge_-_weather_vane_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1264042.jpg')
