values ('신호등 나무 (Traffic Light Sculpture)', NULL, '여러 신호등을 나무처럼 빽빽하게 모아 세운 조형물로, 여러 색 등이 켜져 있다.', 2009, '신호등 부품, 금속 구조', NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','조명','신호등','조형']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1711.webp?v=a7718e9017', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1711.webp?v=fe03c3e49e', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1711.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1711.txt', NULL, 0.082, 'CC BY-SA 2.0', 'Wendy North / From geograph.org.uk / CC BY-SA 2.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Traffic_Light_Sculpture_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1138499.jpg')
