values ('브레멘 시청 풍향계 (Windfahne vom Bremer Rathaus, 1609)', NULL, '1609년 브레멘 시청에 설치되었던 풍향계다. 바람을 받아 회전하며 방향을 알려 주는 구조다.', 1609, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','풍향계','바람']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/2186.webp?v=6047ef19e9', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/2186.webp?v=92ffcc7d9a', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/2186.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/2186.txt', NULL, 0.125, 'CC BY 4.0', 'Focke-Museum Bremen / Online-Sammlung Focke-Museum: https://onlinesammlung.focke-museum.de/exponate/95 / CC BY 4.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Focke-Museum_Bremen_Inv_H-0140_WindfahneRathaus.jpg')
