values ('풍향계 (Weather Vane)', NULL, '마을회관 지붕 위에 설치된 풍향계로, 바람 방향에 따라 회전하며 방위를 가리킨다.', 2006, NULL, NULL, ARRAY['키네틱아트','풍향계','바람','건축장식']::text[], 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/cards/1512.webp?v=73a0e3a6cd', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/display/1512.webp?v=7f0155d561', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/works/1512.jpg', 'https://images.kctikinec.cloud/texts/1512.txt', NULL, 0.066, 'CC BY-SA 2.0', 'Christine Westerback / From geograph.org.uk / CC BY-SA 2.0 / via Wikimedia Commons', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Weather_Vane_-_geograph.org.uk_-_135626.jpg')
